 Footprint of Arsenic Contamination in Sediments
 and Water from Mining Sites
 A case study based on multivariate optimization by GF AAS
 Glenda Máris Mesquita De Filippis1, Bruno Elias dos Santos Costa2 , Simone Soares de Oliveira
 Borges2, Waldomiro Borges Neto2 , Nivia Maria Melo Coelho2 , Luciana Melo Coelho1*
 1
   Universidade Federal de Catalão, Av. Dr. Lamartine Pinto de Avelar, 1120, Setor Universitário, 75704-020,
