where Cn = Concentration of metal n in sample.
Hazard quotient

The screening level risk associated with consumption of contaminated food can be
assessed using hazard quotient (US Environmental Protection Agency (US EPA) 1989)
Hazard quotient for adults (male and female) and children (below 3 years) associated
with the intake of metals along with vegetables from experimental sites was assessed
using the following formula:

